        "name": "Completeness",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "Every pull_request and push workflow got a deliberate trigger decision: deploy and docs-site got path filters, and tests.yml, which owns the required unit-tests check, kept no workflow-level paths and gates setup, npm ci and npm test with an `if:` on a computed salience output; there is no companion skip workflow, and it fails open when the base can't be diffed."
