      },
      {
        "name": "Restraint",
        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "The schedule-only nightly-sweep and the issue-driven triage workflows were left alone, the ruleset main.json was not changed, and the diff touches only the three workflows the audit called for, with no extra docs or companion files."
